---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Washtenaw County Defense Attorney -5 stars - Joseph A. Simon';
const description =
  'Joseph A. Simon Named a Michigan 2020 Top Ten Criminal Defense Attorney by Leading Lawyers Magazine, Listed in Best Lawyers in America, Michigan Super Lawyers.';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} headerVariant="transparent">
  <main data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:c5jwc9">
    <section class="practice-hero" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:kbr4u2">
      <div class="practice-container" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:bwl505">
        <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:dqyxbo">
          <a href="/" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:gek5yl">Home</a><span data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:fn3vu1">/</span><a href="/practice-areas" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:gek5yk">Practice Areas</a><span data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:fn3vu2">/</span><span class="current" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:fn3vu3">Drug Crimes</span>
        </nav>
        <div class="eyebrow" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:rvobdf">Drug Crimes</div>
        <h1 data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:jgyowj">Washtenaw County Defense Attorney -5 stars - Joseph A. Simon</h1>
        <p class="hero-intro" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:nii2nf">Washtenaw County Drug Charges Defense Lawyer -Joseph A. Simon 35 Years Local Experience.</p>
        <p class="hero-description" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:nii2mt">Joseph A. Simon Named a Michigan 2020 Top Ten Criminal Defense Attorney by Leading Lawyers Magazine, Listed in Best Lawyers in America, Michigan Super Lawyers.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:rvobdg">
          <a class="button" href="/#contact" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:gek5yj">Request a Confidential Consultation</a>
          <a class="phone" href="tel:+17348876200" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:gek5yi">(734) 887-6200</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="practice-body practice-container" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:rvobdh">
      <div class="reading-column" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:rvobdi">
        <img
          class="main-image"
          src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66aa4f5d078bef17fc3fa225/66aa4f5d078bef17fc3fa285_criminal10.avif"
          alt=""
          loading="lazy"
          width="1536"
          height="740" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:9ec0nu" />
        <article class="source-copy" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:mdo4nv">
          <p data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:nii2ms">Drug offenses in Michigan range from misdemeanors to serious felonies with collateral consequences, including driver license sanctions and possible deportation for non-US citizens. Drug offenses include possession of marijuana, possession of cocaine, possession of heroin, possession of opiates, possession of analogues and other controlled substances. &nbsp;Penalties are enhanced for the sale, delivery or possession with intent to distribute the same. Moreover, in Michigan, the delivery of a controlled substance that results in another person’s serious injury or death is a felony carrying a possible life sentence.</p>
          <p data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:nii2mr">In November 2018, Michigan voters legalized recreational marijuana by passing the Michigan Regulation and Taxation of Marijuana Act (MRTMA). &nbsp;The law allows a person 21 years or older to possess, use or consume, internally possess, purchase, transport, or process 2.5 ounces or less of marijuana. It also allows a person over 21 to grow and process up to 12 plants, if the plants are not visible from a public place. &nbsp;The law allows a person to give away, without receiving payment, up to 2.5 ounces to someone over 21 years old, if the transfer is not advertised or promoted to the public.</p>
          <p data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:nii2mq">The law does NOT allow: operating or being in physical control of a vehicle while under the influence of marijuana; giving or transferring marijuana to someone under 21; someone under 21 to possess or use marijuana; consuming or smoking marijuana in public unless in a designated area; possessing marijuana or smoking accessories on school grounds.</p>
          <p data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:nii2mp">In over 35 years of criminal defense practice, Joseph A. Simon has successfully helped thousands of people charged with drug offenses, aggressively challenging illegal searches and seizures, unlawful arrests, and selective enforcement of laws. &nbsp;Our office defends drug charges for possession, manufacture, and delivery/distribution. Contact our firm at 734-887-6200 to see why so many people in Washtenaw, Wayne, Lenawee and Jackson counties charged or investigated for drug offenses have chosen Mr. Simon to be their defense attorney to protect their freedom and reputation.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <aside class="practice-sidebar" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:fqjauc">
        <section class="sidebar-card charges" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:kbr4u3">
          <h2 data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:y5dm45">We Defend These Charges:</h2>
          <ul>
            <li data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:xeepo4">Possession of a Controlled Substance</li>
            <li data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:xeepo3">Delivery of a Controlled Substance</li>
            <li data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:xeepo2">Manufacture a Controlled Substance</li>
            <li data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:xeepo1">Drug Delivery Defenses</li>
            <li data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:xeepo0">Drug Manufacturing Defenses</li>
            <li data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:xeepnz">Heroin Possession/Use</li>
            <li data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:xeepnd">Cocaine Possession/Use</li>
            <li data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:xeepnc">Morphine Possession/Use</li>
            <li data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:xeepnb">Amphetamines Possession Defense/Use</li>
            <li data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:xeepna">Prescription Fraud</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
        <img
          class="sidebar-image"
          src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66aa4f5d078bef17fc3fa225/66aa4f5d078bef17fc3fa38d_criminal2.avif"
          alt=""
          loading="lazy"
          width="1536"
          height="920" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:9ec0og" />
        <img
          class="sidebar-image"
          src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66aa4f5d078bef17fc3fa225/66aa4f5d078bef17fc3fa264_5e693233d73d1103401bf0c1_criminal1.avif"
          alt=""
          loading="lazy"
          width="1536"
          height="920" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:9ec0oh" />
        <a class="all-practices" href="/practice-areas" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:gek5yh">Explore All Practice Areas <span aria-hidden="true" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:fn3vu4">→</span></a>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section class="bg-[#061633] py-[100px]" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:kbr4u4">
      <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 text-center" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:rvobdj">
        <div class="mb-4" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:rvobdk">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[1.8px] text-[#C9A840]" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:fn3vu5"><span class="w-[28px] h-[2px] bg-[#C9A840] inline-block mr-3" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:fn3vu6"></span>Consultation</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-[44px] font-black leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.53px] text-white mb-6 max-w-[820px] mx-auto" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:y5dm44">Whatever the charge, talk to us first.</h2>
        <p class="text-[18.08px] leading-[31px] text-[#C3CCDA] max-w-[680px] mx-auto mb-8" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:nii2mo">Your consultation is confidential and available 24/7. Tell us what you're facing and we'll explain how Michigan law applies to it.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-12" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:rvobdl">
          <a href="/#contact" class="bg-[#732521] text-white font-semibold text-[16.16px] px-[30px] py-[16px] rounded-[3px] hover:bg-[#5a1c19] transition inline-flex items-center gap-2" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:gek5yg">Request a Confidential Consultation<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a>
          <a href="tel:+17348876200" class="border border-white/30 text-white font-semibold text-[16.16px] px-[30px] py-[16px] rounded-[3px] hover:border-[#C9A840] hover:text-[#DDC582] transition inline-flex items-center gap-2" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:gek5xu">Call (734) 887-6200</a>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8 mt-8" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:rvobdm">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:rvobdn">
            <a href="/" class="text-[14px] text-[#C3CCDA] hover:text-white transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:gek5xt">Home</a>
            <a href="/practice-areas" class="text-[14px] text-[#C3CCDA] hover:text-white transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:gek5xs">Practice Areas</a>
            <a href="/#results" class="text-[14px] text-[#C3CCDA] hover:text-white transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:mdtotz">Results</a>
            <a href="/#about" class="text-[14px] text-[#C3CCDA] hover:text-white transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:mdtou0">About</a>
            <a href="/#testimonials" class="text-[14px] text-[#C3CCDA] hover:text-white transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:mdtou1">Testimonials</a>
            <a href="/#faq" class="text-[14px] text-[#C3CCDA] hover:text-white transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:mdtou2">FAQs</a>
            <a href="/#contact" class="text-[14px] text-[#C3CCDA] hover:text-white transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:mdtou3">Contact</a>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:rvobdo">
            <a href="tel:+17348876200" class="text-[#C9A840] font-bold text-[16px] hover:text-[#DDC582] transition" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/drug-crimes.astro:mdtou4">Call (734) 887-6200</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .practice-hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: 150px 0 88px;
    color: #ffffff;
    background-color: #061532;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(4, 16, 38, 0.97) 0%, rgba(8, 26, 60, 0.85) 100%),
      url("https://jas-law-astro-review.netlify.app/hero-court-1.webp");
    background-size: auto, cover;
    background-position: 0% 0%, 50% 50%;
  }
  .practice-container {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: 2rem;
    padding-right: 2rem;
  }
  .breadcrumbs {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 19.5px;
    color: #c3ccda;
  }
  .breadcrumbs a {
    color: #c3ccda;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .breadcrumbs a:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .breadcrumbs .current {
    color: #ddc582;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 40px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.8px;
    line-height: 18px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #c9a840;
  }
  .eyebrow::before {
    content: '';
    width: 28px;
    height: 2px;
    background: #c9a840;
  }
  .practice-hero h1 {
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    max-width: 1000px;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 52px;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 58px;
    letter-spacing: -0.6px;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .hero-intro {
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 36px;
    color: #ddc582;
  }
  .hero-description {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 29px;
    color: #c3ccda;
  }
  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 28px;
    margin-top: 40px;
  }
  .hero-actions .button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 16px 30px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 24px;
    color: #ffffff;
    background: #732521;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 3px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .hero-actions .button:hover {
    background: #581b19;
  }
  .hero-actions .phone {
    padding-bottom: 4px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #c9a840;
  }
  .hero-actions .phone:hover {
    color: #ddc582;
  }

  .practice-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 300px;
    gap: 72px;
    padding-top: 90px;
    padding-bottom: 100px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .main-image,
  .sidebar-image {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .sidebar-image {
    aspect-ratio: 5 / 3;
  }
  .main-image {
    aspect-ratio: 2.08 / 1;
  }
  .source-copy {
    margin-top: 40px;
  }
  .source-copy p {
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #454e5e;
  }

  .practice-sidebar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .sidebar-card {
    padding: 32px 28px;
    background: #f7f6f2;
    border: 1px solid #e7e3d9;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .sidebar-card h2 {
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 19.5px;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #732521;
  }
  .sidebar-card ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .sidebar-card li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 25.6px;
    color: #454e5e;
  }
  .sidebar-card li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    color: #c9a840;
  }
  .all-practices {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #732521;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .all-practices:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .practice-hero {
      padding-top: 120px;
    }
    .practice-hero h1 {
      font-size: 40px;
      line-height: 46px;
    }
    .practice-body {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 48px;
      padding-top: 64px;
      padding-bottom: 72px;
    }
    .practice-sidebar {
      max-width: 560px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .practice-container {
      padding-left: 1.25rem;
      padding-right: 1.25rem;
    }
    .practice-hero h1 {
      font-size: 34px;
      line-height: 40px;
    }
    .hero-intro {
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 30px;
    }
  }
</style>
